## 13. Assignment Problem (Brute Force)

```python
from itertools import permutations

cost = [
    [3,10,7],
    [8,5,12],
    [4,6,9]
]

n = len(cost)

min_cost = float("inf")
best = ()

for p in permutations(range(n)):
    total = 0

    for i in range(n):
        total += cost[i][p[i]]

    if total < min_cost:
        min_cost = total
        best = p

print("Assignment:", best)
print("Minimum Cost:", min_cost)
```
